AraunaFirstLinkRuin_Text_Situation::
	.string "The affected POKéMON is trapped\n"
	.string "an old seal and loose stones.\p"
	.string "The structure starts to give.\n"
	.string "You must choose how to act.$"

AraunaFirstLinkRuin_Text_CouragePrompt::
	.string "Rush in and pull the POKéMON\n"
	.string "out before everything falls?\p"
	.string "Act with COURAGE?$"

AraunaFirstLinkRuin_Text_WisdomPrompt::
	.string "Stop and decipher the markings\n"
	.string "that control the mechanism?\p"
	.string "Act with WISDOM?$"

AraunaFirstLinkRuin_Text_CompassionPrompt::
	.string "Calm the POKéMON and follow\n"
	.string "the signs it tries to show?\p"
	.string "Act with COMPASSION?$"

AraunaFirstLinkRuin_Text_ChoicePostponed::
	.string "You step back for now.\p"
	.string "The seal is still unstable, but\n"
	.string "there is still time to act.$"

AraunaFirstLinkRuin_Text_CourageResult::
	.string "You cross the stones before\n"
	.string "the passage collapses.\p"
	.string "The POKéMON escapes, but part\n"
	.string "of the path is buried.$"

AraunaFirstLinkRuin_Text_WisdomResult::
	.string "The markings reveal the correct\n"
	.string "order of the three rings.\p"
	.string "The mechanism stops without\n"
	.string "further damage.$"

AraunaFirstLinkRuin_Text_CompassionResult::
	.string "Your voice eases the POKéMON's\n"
	.string "fear.\p"
	.string "It touches a safe stone and\n"
	.string "reveals a hidden exit.$"

AraunaFirstLinkRuin_Text_PassageStabilized::
	.string "The first BOND has been marked\n"
	.string "on your path.\p"
	.string "A presence waits deeper inside.$"

AraunaFirstLinkRuin_Text_ChamberBlocked::
	.string "The stairs reject your presence.\p"
	.string "The affected POKéMON still needs\n"
	.string "help near the entrance.$"
